                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "1.Sales Dominance: Total sales exceed $450 million, with Spirits being the dominant category, accounting for approximately 64.19% of total sales value, while Wine accounts for the remaining 35.81%.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2.Size Matters: The 750mL and 1750mL sizes are the most popular, driving the vast majority of sales revenue.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3.Profitability Concern: Despite high sales, the overall Gross Profit Margin is approximately 30%, suggesting potential inefficiencies in pricing or Cost of Goods Sold (COGS).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "4.Inventory Inefficiency: The Inventory Turnover Ratio (ITR) is very low at 2.0, indicating slow-moving stock. This is corroborated by the finding that a significant portion of inventory has an average shelf life of 365 days.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "5.Procurement Concentration: Purchasing is heavily concentrated, with DIAGEO NORTH AMERICA INC being the largest vendor by a significant margin.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
